---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home">
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p>Hello world! Here's a future engineer</p>
            <h1>I'm Eugenia Ramirez <br>Systems Engineer</h1>
            
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">[ Python / Pandas ]</span>
                <span class="tag">[ Linux / Proxmox ]</span>
                <span class="tag">[ Lua / LÖVE2D ]</span>
                <span class="tag">[ Databases ]</span>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="#projects" class="btn primary">[ View Projects 📁 ]</a>
                <a href="/Cv_Eugenia_Ramirez.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn secondary">[ Download CV 📄 ]</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 🌟 Imagen Cozy Tech inyectada en el Hero en inglés -->
        <div class="hero-illustration">
            <img 
                src="/images/cozy-desk.jpg" 
                alt="Cozy Tech illustration of server rack, code, and databases" 
                class="cozy-desk-img"
            />
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="projects" class="projects-grid">
        <a href="/en/proyectos/dspace" class="card systems-card">
            <div class="card-header">01 // INFRASTRUCTURE 🗄️</div>
            <h2>DSpace 9.x Core Migration</h2>
            <p>Data migration and architecture upgrade protocol (6.x to 9.x) for the university's institutional repository.</p>
            <div class="card-tags"><span>[Solr]</span><span>[DSpace]</span><span>[Linux]</span><span>[Bash]</span></div>
        </a>

        <a href="/en/proyectos/proxmox" class="card systems-card">
            <div class="card-header">02 // INFRASTRUCTURE 🗄️</div>
            <h2>Server Administration</h2>
            <p>Virtualization management, Proxmox deployment, ZFS file systems, and Nginx reverse proxies at the Telecommunications and Services Department.</p>
            <div class="card-tags"><span>[Proxmox]</span><span>[ZFS]</span><span>[Nginx]</span><span>[PM2]</span></div>
        </a>

        <a href="/en/proyectos/huellasacasa" class="card dev-card">
            <div class="card-header">03 // CREATIVE DEV ⚔️</div>
            <h2>Paws to Home</h2>
            <p>2D platformer video game built with Lua and LÖVE2D featuring custom collision physics and Tiled rendering.</p>
            <div class="card-tags"><span>[Lua]</span><span>[LÖVE2D]</span><span>[Tiled]</span></div>
        </a>

        <a href="/en/proyectos/atlas" class="card data-card">
            <div class="card-header">04 // DATA SCIENCE 🔬</div>
            <h2>ATLAS Pipeline - El Físico Remoto</h2>
            <p>Automated data analysis pipeline for CERN ATLAS open data using interactive notebooks and scientific visualization for CoAfina.</p>
            <div class="card-tags"><span>[Python]</span><span>[Marimo]</span><span>[GitHub Actions]</span></div>
        </a>

        <a href="/en/proyectos/churn" class="card data-card">
            <div class="card-header">05 // DATA SCIENCE 📊</div>
            <h2>Stochastic Churn Analysis</h2>
            <p>Data processing, cleaning, and mining of the IBM Telco Customer Churn dataset to identify customer attrition probabilities.</p>
            <div class="card-tags"><span>[Stochastics]</span><span>[Pandas]</span><span>[Data Mining]</span></div>
        </a>
    </section>

    <!-- 🌟 Sección About Me actualizada con el diseño dividido -->
    <section id="about-me" class="about-section">
        <div class="about-header">
            <h2>~/About_me 💻</h2>
            <p class="about-subtitle">Location: Mérida, Venezuela ⛰️ // Role: Systems Engineering Student (ULA) & IT Support Assistant (DTES)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card-split">
            <div class="about-content-box">
                <p>I am a Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Los Andes (ULA) and an IT Support Assistant at the Telecommunications and Services Department (DTES). I specialize in building and administering IT infrastructure (Linux, Proxmox, ZFS) to ensure network service availability, while concurrently developing software architectures and analytical interfaces.</p>
                <br>
                <p>When I am not executing repository migrations in PostgreSQL, wrestling with C++ code, or fine-tuning physics collisions in Lua, you will likely find me baking desserts (like traditional panettone), playing Stardew Valley, or hanging out with my cat, Tito.</p>
                
                <div class="about-skills">
                    <span>[ Linux Servers ]</span>
                    <span>[ Proxmox & ZFS ]</span>
                    <span>[ Lua / LÖVE2D ]</span>
                    <span>[ Python & Data ]</span>
                </div>

                <div class="social-links-cozy">
                    <a href="https://github.com/eunight" target="_blank" class="btn-cozy">[ GitHub ↗ ]</a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eunight" target="_blank" class="btn-cozy">[ LinkedIn ↗ ]</a>
                    <a href="mailto:eugeniandreina@gmail.com" class="btn-cozy">[ Email ✉ ]</a>
                </div>  
            </div>
            
            <div class="about-image-box">
                <img src="/images/sobre_mi.jpg" alt="Cozy workspace illustration in Mérida with Tito" class="cozy-illustration-img" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>